  "patch_change": {
    "source_ref_id": "source:riot-patch-notes:26.16",
    "status": "listed",
    "text_en": "Poppy Poppy is meant to be a tank whose gameplay has leaned too far into early game snowball fighter, to the point she's choosing Hail of Blades and Sundered Sky over more tank runes and items. We're looking to shift power out of her early game AD fighter pattern and enable her tank pattern by significantly increasing her scaling with durability and giving her enough mana growth that sustained combat doesn't immediately run her out of resources. Base Stats Attack Damage : 60 ⇒ 56 Health Regeneration : 8 ⇒ 9 Mana : 280 + 40/level ⇒ 300 + 45/level Q - Hammer Shock Damage : 30 / 55 / 80 / 105 / 130 (+100% bonus Attack Damage) (+9% Target Maximum Health), twice ⇒ 30 / 55 / 80 / 105 / 130 (+75% bonus Attack Damage) (+7 / 7.5 / 8 / 8.5 / 9% Target Maximum Health), twice Target Maximum Health Monster Cap : 75 / 105 / 135 / 165 / 195 ⇒ 85 / 120 / 155 / 190 / 225 Slow Amount : 20 / 25 / 30 / 35 / 40% ⇒ 20 / 23 / 26 / 29 / 32% (+8% per 1000 bonus Health) W - Steadfast Presence Total Armor and Magic Resistance : 12%, doubled below 40% Maximum Health ⇒ 16%, doubled below 40% Maximum Health"
  },
